{"articleNo":"85500","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=85500&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013년 청춘 KEPCO 서포터즈 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.06.20","hit":"4720","attachments":[{"name":"KEPCO 포스터.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=85500&attachNo=71656"},{"name":"청춘KEPCO서포터즈지원서(기본양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=85500&attachNo=71761"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">□ </span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>공모개요<br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">한국전력공사에서는 대학생 여러분의 신선한 아이디어에 귀를 기울이고 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">보다 나은 서비스로 국민과 함께하는 <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">KEPCO</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">가 되고자 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">청춘</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">KEPCO </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">대학생 서포터즈를 모집합니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 끼와 열정 넘치는 대학생 여러분의 많은 참여를 기다립니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\"><br><strong>□ </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>접수기간 및 일정<br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">접수기간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: <strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">2013. 6.20 ~ 2013. 7.10<br></font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">활동기간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2013. 7.23 ~ 2013.11.22(4</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개월간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\"><br><strong>□ </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>참가자격<br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">한전을 사랑하고 전력서비스에 관심있는 열정적인 대학생으로 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">온</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">오프라인으로 진행되는 미션활동 가능한자<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\"><br>&nbsp; ★ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">우대사항<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">블로그</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">,SNS </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">등 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">인 미디어 활동을 활발히 하는자<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">서포터즈 관련 업무 유 경험자<br><br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\"><strong>□ </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>활동내용<br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전력서비스 모니터링<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">서비스 홍보</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">아이디어 제안<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기타 특별한 체험활동<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">회 정기미팅<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\"><br><strong>□ </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>응모방법<br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">인 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">팀으로 구성하여 팀 지원서 및 팀 소개서 작성 후 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">E-mail(<a href=\"mailto:supporters@kepco.co.kr\"><strong><font color=\"#4169e1\"><u>supporters@kepco.co.kr</u></font></strong></a>)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"> 접수<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">상세내용 지원서 작성요령 참조</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)<br><br><strong>□ 제출서류</strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong><br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 팀지원서(기본양식 다운로드), 팀소개서(자유양식)</span><br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\"><br><strong>□ </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>관련문의<br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">한국전력공사 마케팅처 고객감동팀 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(<a href=\"mailto:supporters@kepco.co.kr\"><strong><font color=\"#4169e1\"><u>supporters@kepco.co.kr</u></font></strong></a>&nbsp;/ 02-3456-4562, 4541)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; - 홈페이지 : <strong><a href=\"http://www.kepco.co.kr/\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#4169e1\"><u>http://www.kepco.co.kr</u></font></a></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
